            >
              Autism &amp; Sensory Experience
            </h2>
            <p
              class="mt-5 md:mt-7 max-w-[24rem] text-[1.15rem] md:text-[1.5rem] font-medium leading-[1.5] text-[#6b6b6b] dark:text-slate-200"
